```css
.card {
  position: relative;          /* reference for the badge */
  padding: 1rem;
  padding-inline-end: 4.5rem;  /* reserve room so the title never runs under the badge */
}
.card__badge {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0.75rem;
  right: 0.75rem;
}
.site-header { position: sticky; top: 0; }   /* sticks while scrolling */
```

| Value | In flow? | Positioned relative to |
|---|---|---|
| static (default). | yes. | — |
| relative. | yes (space kept). | its own normal position. |
| absolute. | no. | nearest positioned ancestor. |
| fixed. | no. | the viewport. |
| sticky. | yes, until it sticks. | its scroll container, within its parent. |

